years later. I mean, if you think about that,
you know, advancement in technology and just

01:18:25.380 --> 01:18:33.420
barely over 50 years, what our potential is.
Now, whether we, you know, use that potential

01:18:33.420 --> 01:18:40.450
to create a space industry that is vibrant,
that have, have a, a lot of people, uh, having

01:18:40.450 --> 01:18:45.860
access to space, to going back to the moon
and Mars. I don't know, you know, if you consider

01:18:45.860 --> 01:18:50.991
the fact that there are going to be people
in the U S air force flying the B52, that's

01:18:50.991 --> 01:18:57.030
going to be a hundred years old at one point.
People will be flying a hundred year old airplane

