said?
No, I don't want to answer that one. I want

01:19:32.420 --> 01:19:38.340
to, uh, I want to say what 50 years from now
will bring.

01:19:38.340 --> 01:19:40.790
Well go ahead and, uh, you get to do what
you want.

01:19:40.790 --> 01:19:47.489
And, and I, I don't know, I haven't a clue,
but I think you will figure it out. I think

01:19:47.489 --> 01:19:54.510
the young people today are smarter. There's
you guys, or men and women, black, white,

01:19:54.510 --> 01:19:59.349
whatever. You're smarter than I am. You'll
figure it out. You have, you're working from

01:19:59.349 --> 01:20:05.081
a, a bigger database. Part of that thanks
to the space program. Most of it not, but

01:20:05.081 --> 01:20:10.480
you'll, you'll, you'll work it out. I'm very
optimistic. Uh, that, uh, your, your future

01:20:10.480 --> 01:20:17.000
that you will chart as time goes by, is better
